	What you've probably discovered is the Wizard's tower.  The most
common method of entering that region is this: On one of the levels below the
tower will be one of those '+' shaped rooms, like the ones in which you'd find
the Wizard in version 3.0.  In the center of that room will be a portal that
gives you access to the interior of the Wizard's tower.  Actually, you'll
probably find more than one plus-shaped room, but only one has that portal.
You could also enter by polymorphing into a Xorn or an Earth Elemental and
simply walking through the walls.

